  "howToPick": "Check the FSSAI licence number and the \"no added sugar\" claim; look for thick, slow-flowing honey with a floral smell. Syrup adulteration is a known problem in India: surveys by the Centre for Science and Environment (CSE) in 2020 reported sugar syrup in many branded samples (see section 9). Home tests (a drop in water, a flame test) are not reliable; only lab tests such as NMR are.",
